# The next open of reports-beside-an-extension.drive's workspace: what csv-table gave is kept,
# so its files' reports come with the boards' as the workspace opens. csv-table's are said at
# once, and the boards' one line waits until they have had their time.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for csv-table couldn't read Volcanoes/
expect-not boards have cards left out
wait-for 8s 2 boards have cards left out (cold-lava items shows each): Ashfall, Lahar
keys q
exits 0
